strconv.ErrRange, each with the chain *strconv.NumError.Unwrap then
fmt.Errorf "version %q: %w". Statically the base/bit-size errors of strconv.toError and
its "return err" fall-through (internal/strconv.Error, Go >= 1.26) are listed as well.
